],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"映襯","subject":"國文","category":"修辭","plain_explanation":"把相反或差異明顯的事物放在一起，使特徵更突出。","exam_tip":"先找句中成對的相反概念。","question_count":0,"years":[],"question_ids":[],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"轉化","subject":"國文","category":"修辭","plain_explanation":"把人的性質寫給物，或把物的性質寫給人，使形象更鮮明。","exam_tip":"看到無生命事物會說話、思考，常是擬人。","question_count":0,"years":[],"question_ids":[],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"轉品","subject":"國文","category":"修辭","plain_explanation":"詞語在句中改變原本詞性使用，例如把名詞當動詞。","exam_tip":"不要只看字典詞性，要看它在該句負責什麼功能。","question_count":0,"years":[],"question_ids":[],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"通假字","subject":"國文","category":"文字","plain_explanation":"古文借用讀音相同或相近的字，代替本來應寫的字。","exam_tip":"必須放回上下文換字，確認句意才通。","question_count":0,"years":[],"question_ids":[],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"題旨","subject":"國文","category":"作文","plain_explanation":"作文題目要求考生回應的核心問題與範圍。","exam_tip":"下筆前把題目改寫成一句『我要證明什麼』。","question_count":0,"years":[],"question_ids":[],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"駢文","subject":"國文","category":"文體","plain_explanation":"講求對偶、聲律與辭藻，常以四字、六字句相間的文體。","exam_tip":"看整齊對偶與典故密度，不只看句子長短。","question_count":0,"years":[],"question_ids":[],"essay_question_count":0,"essay_question_ids":[],"essay_years":[]},{"term":"土地增值稅","subject":"土地法與土地相關稅法概要","category":"土地稅","plain_explanation":"土地所有權移轉時，就公告土地現值所反映的土地漲價總數額課稅。","exam_tip":"先判斷納稅義務人、稅基與優惠或免徵要件。","question_count":37,"years":[114,113,112,111,110,109,108,107,106,105,104],"question_ids":[216,228,229,231,232,393,394,396,409,424,575,578,584,585,586,593,594,595,573,744,754,733,876,975,977,1090,1101,1102,1081,1195,1192,1304,1305,1306,1434,81,56],"essay_question_count":5,"essay_question_ids":[56,573,733,1081,1192],"essay_years":[114,111,110,107,106]},{"term":